  "post_content": "<p style=\"margin: 0px; text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2019/10/IMG_2684.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; font-family: &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); display: inline; float: none; font-family: Arial,Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: justify; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\">(26 fotos) </span>La sede de la Mancomunidad Espad&aacute;n Mijares en Tales ha acogido recientemente una jornada empresarial promovida por el director del Pacto Territorial por el Empleo EXMemII, Evaristo San Miguel.</font></span></span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; text-align: justify;\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2019/10/IMG_2692.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; font-family: &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\"><font color=\"#000000\">La jornada fue un &eacute;xito en participaci&oacute;n e implicaci&oacute;n de las personas asistentes, que tambi&eacute;n realizaron un taller pr&aacute;ctico. Se trataron tanto temas estrat&eacute;gicos de promoci&oacute;n, supervivencia y &eacute;xito empresarial como aspectos de diversificaci&oacute;n de negocios. Tambi&eacute;n se inform&oacute; sobre subvenciones para nuevas actividades, adquisici&oacute;n de maquinaria e instalaciones de empresas existentes.</font></span></span></p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/jornadaempresarialmancomunitat260919/img_2661.jpg\" alt=\"img_2661\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/jornadaempresarialmancomunitat260919/img_2662.jpg\" alt=\"img_2662\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/jornadaempresarialmancomunitat260919/img_2663.jpg\" alt=\"img_2663\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/jornadaempresarialmancomunitat260919/img_2664.jpg\" alt=\"img_2664\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/jornadaempresarialmancomunitat260919/img_2668.jpg\" alt=\"img_2668\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/jornadaempresarialmancomunitat260919/img_2671.jpg\" alt=\"img_2671\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/jornadaempresarialmancomunitat260919/img_2673.jpg\" alt=\"img_2673\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/jornadaempresarialmancomunitat260919/img_2675.jpg\" alt=\"img_2675\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/jornadaempresarialmancomunitat260919/img_2676.jpg\" alt=\"img_2676\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/jornadaempresarialmancomunitat260919/img_2677.jpg\" alt=\"img_2677\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/jornadaempresarialmancomunitat260919/img_2680.jpg\" alt=\"img_2680\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/jornadaempresarialmancomunitat260919/img_2682.jpg\" alt=\"img_2682\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;